This woman is paying her taxes.
What role does that make her within the Lam Rim system?

00:03:35.680 --> 00:03:36.760
It made her...

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:42.800
a sorceress.  When I say a Shaman,
or a Tantric Master,

00:03:43.560 --> 00:03:46.040
