I'll give you a second
to try and figure out what this picture is about.

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:45.200
Pabongka Rinpoche quoted from
several books.

00:10:46.320 --> 00:10:48.320
with an ending that is very, very common for
various books.

00:10:48.800 --> 00:10:59.080
He quoted from a famous book,
BLO BZANG RGYAL BA'I BSTAN PA ... CIG,

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:04.040
praying that the teachings of
the Victorious

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:07.000
Lobsang Drakpa, Je Tsongkapa, may

00:11:07.480 --> 00:11:09.480
spread throughout the world.

00:11:09.960 --> 00:11:14.040
You're probably thinking,
we've got access to the Internet.

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:17.400
We need to translate this Lam Rim
into many languages.

00:11:18.720 --> 00:11:23.000
We must strive to spread kindness
to as many people as possible.

00:11:24.040 --> 00:11:32.600
That's the final part of the prayer, and we have to
step out of this Lam Rim class or video

00:11:32.600 --> 00:11:37.200
and share the Dharma
with others.

00:11:37.200 --> 00:11:39.720
We must spread France throughout the world.

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:45.680
In this part of the Lam Rim,
Pabongka Rinpoche said:

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:52.160
the place where you must spread the Dharma is here,
in your own hearts.

00:11:52.240 --> 00:11:57.560
Don't think that spreading the word means
