00:18:15.200 --> 00:18:17.920
the vows of the monks,
The vows of the bhikkhuni.

00:18:18.520 --> 00:18:26.560
They are talking about vows,
traditions that we shouldn't...

00:18:26.800 --> 00:18:31.160
When you become a monk or a nun,
they give you robes, they give you

00:18:31.200 --> 00:18:33.200
a small Buddha statue,

00:18:34.320 --> 00:18:36.320
and they give you a water filter.

00:18:37.280 --> 00:18:40.720
And in ancient India, you had to carry
this water filter with you.

00:18:41.480 --> 00:18:44.800
When you drink water from a stream,

00:18:45.400 --> 00:18:50.920
