just one.

01:13:23.760 --> 01:13:26.080
So, I have panda chocolate.

01:13:27.000 --> 01:13:30.240
This is what you give to your teacher
when they teach you about Bodhicitta.  Let's reach an

01:13:31.080 --> 01:13:33.200
agreement.  Practice that experience

01:13:34.160 --> 01:13:36.040
over the next few months

01:13:37.000 --> 01:13:41.760
.  Please practice the
dedication chapter of Shantideva (the Great Deva)
during your meditation sessions.

01:13:43.680 --> 01:13:48.600
Keep working hard to gain that experience.  The
worst thing that could happen is that at least

01:13:49.400 --> 01:13:52.440
you will sow the seeds in
your minds to have that experience.

01:13:53.280 --> 01:13:55.080
Just pretending.

01:13:55.080 --> 01:13:59.680
Just sit down and imagine it.
Imagination is good for meditation.

01:14:00.880 --> 01:14:03.000
Imagine that you all have the experience
of this encounter,

01:14:03.840 --> 01:14:05.080
one by one,

01:14:05.080 --> 01:14:06.640
each and every being.

01:14:06.640 --> 01:14:10.160
You make a personal commitment to
each living being

01:14:10.800 --> 01:14:13.400
to care for them in the ultimate way.

01:14:14.160 --> 01:14:18.080
Okay.  See you at the next Lam Rim course
on the Medicine Buddha.  I'm so happy!

